cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dashboard or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Beyond Articles: metadata completeness of Chilean research outputs other than articles"
abstract: >-
  A dashboard of how completely Chilean research outputs that are not articles (datasets, images,
  software, data management plans and others) are described: those in DataCite with a creator
  affiliated in Chile, and those in ANID's repository. It shows where they are deposited, under which
  licence, and how completely they are described. Each record is checked for ten metadata fields. The harvest and scoring pipeline is in
  the repository; the aggregated results in data/dashboard/ are under CC BY 4.0. Code under MIT.
